msgstr "引擎網址（伺服器用）"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:219
msgid "Key ID"
msgstr "金鑰名稱"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:219
msgid "The name this site is registered under at the engine."
msgstr "本站在引擎登記時使用的名稱。"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:220
msgid "Default engine language"
msgstr "預設引擎語言"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:221
msgid "Language map"
msgstr "語言對照"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:222
msgid "Tool pages"
msgstr "工具頁面"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:222
msgid "One per line: tool=page ID. When the embedded tool links to another tool, the visitor goes to that page."
msgstr "每行一筆：工具=頁面 ID。嵌入的工具連到另一個工具時，訪客會被帶到這個頁面。"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:236
msgid "Site key"
msgstr "站台金鑰"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:237
msgid "This site signs its requests to the engine with an Ed25519 key. The private half never leaves this site; register the public key below with the engine under the key ID above."
msgstr "本站以 Ed25519 金鑰為送往引擎的請求簽章。私鑰只留在本站；請把下方的公鑰以上面的金鑰名稱登記到引擎。"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:243
msgid "No key yet."
msgstr "尚未建立金鑰。"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:250
msgid "I understand the old key stops working until the new public key is registered at the engine."
msgstr "我了解：新公鑰登記到引擎之前，舊金鑰就會失效。"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:252
msgid "Rotate key"
msgstr "更換金鑰"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:252
msgid "Generate key"
msgstr "建立金鑰"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:263
msgid "Member pseudonyms"
msgstr "會員代號"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:264
msgid "The engine never sees member IDs or e-mails, only HMAC(salt, user ID). Rotating the salt makes every member look new to the engine (usage limits restart)."
msgstr "引擎看不到會員 ID 或電子郵件，只看到 HMAC(鹽, 使用者 ID)。更換鹽之後，每位會員在引擎看來都是新的（用量限制重新計算）。"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:266
msgid "Yes, rotate the salt."
msgstr "是，更換鹽。"

#: includes/Admin/SettingsPage.php:267
msgid "Rotate salt"
msgstr "更換鹽"

